      "title": "Most time in GC",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "description": "The highest share of time any selected process spends in garbage collection pauses. Concurrent collectors, which run beside the application, are left out.",
